<title>RUSSIA: Russia raises OFZ bond coupon rate to 14.78 pct.</title>
<headline>Russia raises OFZ bond coupon rate to 14.78 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Finance Ministry has raised the fifth coupon rate of series 24008 OFZ interest-bearing bond to 14.78 percent from 13.84 percent, the central bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>			   fifth coupon	  fourth coupon</p>
<p>    pct		  14.78		   30.19</p>
<p>    roubles	    36,849		  34,500</p>
<p>    payment date     Oct 15, 1997	  July 16, 1997</p>
<p>On July 16 the Finance Ministry will repay the bond on a voluntary basis as part of its effort to clear its books of non-tax liable bonds. Russia has begun issuing tax-liable bonds.</p>
<p>--Anna Smirnova, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
